INDEX .claude/skills/
D index-find/              Find a file or dir through the directory indexes
D index-audit-partial/     Run the whole pre-commit gate (both checkers) over the staged diff on demand
D symbol-find-js/          Find which JavaScript file defines a symbol
D symbol-find-py/          Find which Python file defines a symbol
D symbol-find-bash/        Find which bash file defines a symbol
D symbol-find-sh/          Find which POSIX sh file defines a symbol
D symbol-dupecheck-js/     Check whether a JavaScript symbol name is already taken
D symbol-dupecheck-py/     Check whether a Python symbol name is already taken
D symbol-dupecheck-bash/   Check whether a bash symbol name is already taken
D symbol-dupecheck-sh/     Check whether a POSIX sh symbol name is already taken
D symbol-deps/             What a file depends on, and which files depend on it
